# Domain (DDD)

- Use vocabulary from root `CONTEXT.md` (claim, verdict, session, preset, trusted source, etc.).
- Do not invent alternate names for the same concepts.
- Before architectural changes, check `docs/adr/`; add an ADR when a lasting decision is made.
- See `docs/agents/domain.md` for how skills consume domain docs.
- Align code and tests with domain terms (e.g. verdict types, claim text dedupe).
